	(text "FPGA bank 13 connects by RGMII to U902, the DP83867IRRGZR PHY. Four MDI\ndifferential pairs pass through T900 magnetics to J900 RJ45. MDC/MDIO\nconfigure and read the PHY; PHY_INT_N reports events. Ethernet framing and\nnetwork protocols are implemented by the FPGA design and software."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 42.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
