	(text "U904 through U907 protect the four Ethernet pairs. Four 75 ohm resistors join\ncable-side centre taps to BS_NODE, which couples to CHASSIS through C938.\nR921 and C937 connect chassis to circuit ground. R914 and R915 limit the\nRJ45 status LED currents."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 100.065 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "79af24c2-9ee4-48d3-b16d-3334bf47d995")
	)
	(text "Y900 is a 25 MHz crystal with 22 pF capacitors. R906 is the 11 kohm bias\nresistor. Resistor pairs on PHY_RXD0 and PHY_RX_CTL establish startup strap\nlevels. PHY_RESET_N reaches the local reset node through 1 kohm R913; R916\nand C932 provide pull-up and filtering."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 62.306 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7f819c3a-2dd0-4a60-9a02-003bce54414f")
	)
