	(text "IO3V3 powers the I/O pins. U903 generates PHY2V5 from IO3V3 for the analog\nsupply. PHY1V05 is a separate incoming core rail. The grouped 100 nF, 1 uF and\n4.7 uF capacitors bypass the corresponding physical supply pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
