	(text "U900 forwards SCK, MOSI, CS_N and periodic HOST_ALIVE, powered by IO3V3.\nHOST_ALIVE is now a pulse train, not a static ready flag; FPGA must track it.\nU901 returns MISO, FPGA_IRQ, FPGA_DONE and FPGA_INIT_N from SYS3V3.\nBoth use 74LVC125APW,118 with Ioff; C907 decouples U901.\nU901 3Y/4Y drive PC6/PC7; OE pins stay low, 100k define startup levels.\nSCK uses U500.Y11 (SRCC, bank 13); AB12 is unused. See digital-interfaces review." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 315 120.032 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (color 0 70 160 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f0442b79-17f8-4c54-9f8d-719b34656b2d"))
